<section class="page-hero reveal">
  <p class="eyebrow">Install</p>
  <h1>Download and run Arlen</h1>
  <p class="lead">
    Install from source, scaffold a new app, and ship with a predictable CLI-first workflow.
  </p>
</section>

<section class="steps-grid">
  <article class="step-card reveal">
    <h2>Clone and build Arlen</h2>
    <pre><code><%= [ctx objectForKey:@"cloneCommand"] %></code></pre>
  </article>

  <article class="step-card reveal reveal-delay-1">
    <h2>Create your first app</h2>
    <pre><code><%= [ctx objectForKey:@"scaffoldCommand"] %></code></pre>
  </article>

  <article class="step-card reveal reveal-delay-2">
    <h2>Serve your app</h2>
    <pre><code><%= [ctx objectForKey:@"serveCommand"] %></code></pre>
  </article>
</section>

<section class="section-block reveal">
  <h2>Production path</h2>
  <p>
    Use `propane` for worker management, graceful restarts, and predictable production controls.
  </p>
  <p>
    Pair `propane` with your preferred process supervisor and deployment platform.
  </p>
</section>
